00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.813
But the difference between the
network tiers is really simple.

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:16.970
The Premium Tier leverages
the entire global network.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.970
So your traffic can enter
our network anywhere,

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.550
and it can exit
anywhere in the network.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:25.660
The regional services, or
the Standard Network Tier,

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:30.880
allows traffic to enter
in a regional location

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:35.020
or someplace approximately
close to a region, so the pops

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.460
nearby a region.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:41.270
And also that allows traffic
to only exit those places.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:45.460
And these are choices that
you might make based on cost.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:50.950
You might make them based
